# Changelog

## [0.1.0] — 2026-09-08
- Initial scaffold: dual-mode (ats/modern) x dual-lang (ID/EN), 4 PDF outputs.
- `config/order.tex` for section order/on-off, folder-per-variant templates.
- `compile.sh` port from template-ta + `--check-ats` validation.
- Minimal-modular sections: summary, education, experience, projects, skills (+ optional certifications, organizations).
